Spec: Private application socket lifecycle verification

Purpose:
  Verify the real Java socket adapter preserves FIN and releases blocked resources when its application closes.

Owns:
  ./SocketAdapterTest.java

Must:
  A descriptor read failure interrupts the application's blocked read instead of returning a fabricated normal EOF.
  Exercise actual local TCP sockets with request FIN, response integrity, blocked disposal and second-worker rejection.
  Bound every fixture operation and stop only owned executor threads and sockets.
